{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the flash game 'Strengthening Sword', this game was created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is the same as the 3D Vampire Survival genre, but other content is point-and-click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player has nothing but 2000 gold that was initially given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I recommend you buy a wood sword with that sword, because you have to kill the monster to get the item!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you get the item, you can build a sword that is stronger than a wood sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you make a sword, you can go to the store and sell it. Weapons only, material items cannot be sold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think about how to make gold and survive to the end by monsters for 2 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Player - WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack Key - Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Item - Drag and Drop</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3216310?t=1745319313","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216310/be819741747438af91166d4675258be9dfad6da7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745319313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216310/cfb5b268ee52e36dac5eb093480429c5b2dfada5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745319313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216310/cfb5b268ee52e36dac5eb093480429c5b2dfada5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745319313","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the flash game 'Strengthening Sword', this game was created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is the same as the 3D Vampire Survival genre, but other content is point-and-click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player has nothing but 2000 gold that was initially given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I recommend you buy a wood sword with that sword, because you have to kill the monster to get the item!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you get the item, you can build a sword that is stronger than a wood sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you make a sword, you can go to the store and sell it. Weapons only, material items cannot be sold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think about how to make gold and survive to the end by monsters for 2 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Player - WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack Key - Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Item - Drag and Drop</p>","developers":["Bagilmong"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216310/b4b4dfbfe7f6f283aa2d77f0f1b121234f59fae6/header.jpg?t=1745319313","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3216310/856511/88642280c6880bf70c6a80ac631f70d1b44ba693/1750881828/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743509609","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3216310/856511/88642280c6880bf70c6a80ac631f70d1b44ba693/1750881828/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743509609","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3216310/856511/88642280c6880bf70c6a80ac631f70d1b44ba693/1750881828/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743509609","id":257117815,"name":"Bagilmong","thumbnail":"https://shared.akama